{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:46 2026-10-19 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:46 2026-10-19 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:46 2026-10-19 HKT</p><img alt=\"葉楚航（右）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/d3ee9451cd3ced17912b6493d6114b07/2026-10/179239590743186.jpg\"/><p>戰至十月中，葉楚航今日終憑第六場「杭至尊」勝出季內首場頭馬，今場亦是練者在港從練以來的第900W；賽後葉楚航即舉起九隻手指以示慶祝。</p><p>「杭至尊」之前在港十戰未勝，上仗配班德禮在田草直路賽跑獲季軍昨日原班人馬再戰同程，結果順利壓到「晨曦鳳凰」，順利打開在港勝門。</p><img alt=\"「杭至尊」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9c2792ede2586cd8f1b7769e21b83b2e/2026-10/179239594385600.jpg\" title=\"「杭至尊」\"/><p>「杭至尊」</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T07:58:58.059894+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":219,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T07:46:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T08:37:52.943410+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T07:57:36.041108+00:00","content_hash":"8474461540b25054f9ba724ab48f52c395cef4b1122e11e7420cee6808e47370","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}